## Notes for thesis author

**Required mix per `thesis-content-standard.md` §C3:**
- Total ≥30 entries (cử nhân) / ≥50 (kỹ sư) / ≥80 (thạc sĩ)
- ≥30% peer-reviewed papers
- ≥1-2 your department's giáo trình
- VN laws if scope touches user data / education / payment

**Citation discipline:**
- Body cite `[N]` ordinal by first appearance (NOT alphabetical)
- Direct quotes: page-num mandatory `[15, tr.314]`
- Web URLs: include access date `(accessed DD-MMM-YYYY)`

**Anti-patterns (per rule §C5 Standalone-document principle):**
- KHÔNG cite internal `documents/04-quality/audits/*.md` audit reports
- KHÔNG cite internal chapter MD cross-refs as bibliography
- KHÔNG cite internal `documents/03-planning/*.md` plans
- Bibliography refs ONLY from public sources (papers / standards / official vendor docs / regulator gov.vn)

**Validation script:**

```bash
# Verify 100% inline cite utilization (rule §C3)
for n in $(grep -oP '^\[\d+\]' documents/<thesis-dir>/references/bibliography.md | tr -d '[]'); do
  grep -q "\[$n[,\]]" documents/<thesis-dir>/chapters/*.md || echo "Orphan: [$n] in bibliography but never cited"
done
```
